Package: BOBgmms
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Optimized Bootstrap for Approximate Posterior Sampling
        in Gaussian Mixture Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Santiago", family = "Marin", role = c("aut", "cre"), 
      email = "santiago.marinardila@anu.edu.au", 
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-0086-3721")
    ))
Description: 
    Approximately sample from the posterior distribution of Gaussian mixture
    models under conjugate priors with the Weighted Bayesian Bootstrap (Newton 
    et al. 2020 <https://doi.org/10.1002/cjs.11570>) and the Bayesian Optimized 
    Bootstrap (Marin et al. 2025+ <https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2311.03644>). 
